Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 08:12:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] test: the chaos lab waits out a rehearsal of many pieces

`settle` lets timers fire for eight rounds. A rehearsal hands the presenter one piece to
a timer, and there are as many pieces as displays and apps: with two displays and seven
apps there are nine, and a list that ends was taken for a timer that never rests
(`restless-rehearsal`). No committed walk met it; a new kind of command shifts every walk,
and one then does.

`settle` now waits a rehearsal out, up to 64 pieces, so that one that never ends is still
found restless. The script is ten lines, with no command in it, at the settings that ship.
